        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Silk ribbon, England, 1820s-1830s"@en , "Silk ribbon woven in an open white tabby net with a rose on a branch in shaded pink silk brocaded in the warp. The rose is shaded from deep pink on the right to white on the left. Each selvedge consists of a narrow satin stripe with a deckled edge in white silk."@en ;
